## About This Project
This repository contains a simple, responsive personal Curriculum Vitae (CV)
web page built with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.

## Files
- `index.html` — main CV page
- `styles.css` — styling (responsive, with light/dark theme toggle)
- `script.js` — interactivity (theme toggle, small animations)
